across Cardiff and the rest of the UK quick and convenient.  ",[],"ltr",{"type":64,"text":69,"spans":70,"direction":67},"Open late, 7 days a week, our network of over 12,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers gives you the flexibility to send parcels in a way that fits around your schedule. Plus, our affordable Courier services in Cardiff make it easy to save money on every parcel you send. ",[],{"type":64,"text":72,"spans":73,"direction":67},"Explore our prices below to see how much you could save when choosing our Cardiff delivery services, or discover our other locations, including our couriers in Birmingham as well as couriers in Leeds, and more.  ",[74,82],{"start":75,"end":76,"type":77,"data":78},148,170,"hyperlink",{"link_type":79,"url":80,"target":81},"Web","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service-edinburgh","_blank",{"start":83,"end":84,"type":77,"data":85},182,199,{"link_type":79,"url":86,"target":81},"courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service-leeds","Our prices",{"link_type":79,"key":89,"url":90},"d631861a-a211-40a0-b59b-dadfb397631d","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Four-prices","card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":94,"version":25,"items":95,"primary":144,"id":147,"slice_type":148,"slice_label":44},"photoListComponent",[96,109,127],{"title":97,"content":98,"isNumbered":20,"image":102},"Send a parcel in the UK",[99],{"type":64,"text":100,"spans":101,"direction":67},"Our ParcelShops, Lockers and couriers are on hand to help you send parcels throughout the whole of the UK.  ",[],{"dimensions":103,"alt":105,"copyright":44,"url":106,"id":107,"edit":108},{"width":52,"height":104},666,"Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront.","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7b6kZ7c43Q3f_73_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847-1-.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z7b6kZ7c43Q3f_73",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":110,"content":111,"isNumbered":20,"image":120},"Send a parcel internationally",[112],{"type":64,"text":113,"spans":114,"direction":67},"Have a package to go overseas? With Evri, you can send parcels to 200+ countries and territories. Find out more about our International courier services.  ",[115],{"start":116,"end":117,"type":77,"data":118},122,153,{"link_type":79,"url":119,"target":81},"courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services",{"dimensions":121,"alt":44,"copyright":44,"url":123,"id":124,"edit":125},{"width":52,"height":122},667,"courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2%2C6016%2C4013&w=1000&h=667","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":57,"y":126,"zoom":58,"background":59},2,{"title":128,"content":129,"isNumbered":20,"image":138},"Collect a parcel",[130],{"type":64,"text":131,"spans":132,"direction":67},"Our Lockers and ParcelShops are not just for sending parcels but also collecting parcels when it’s convenient for you. With our ParcelShop to ParcelShop service, you can also choose to send items from one ParcelShop to another, ready for the recipient to collect when convenient for them. ",[133],{"start":134,"end":135,"type":77,"data":136},128,160,{"link_type":79,"url":137,"target":81},"courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fparcelshop-delivery",{"dimensions":139,"alt":140,"copyright":44,"url":141,"id":142,"edit":143},{"width":52,"height":122},"A female courier hands a parcel to a recipient. A blue Evri van can be seen in the background.","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FabpmU7bci2UF6Kff_Couriertipping.jpg?auto=format,compress","abpmU7bci2UF6Kff",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"theme":145,"title":146,"description":44},"standard","Send, collect and return parcels with Evri","list_block$a3df3991-452a-4275-ad05-63ba74761268","list_block",{"variation":150,"version":25,"items":151,"primary":214,"id":225,"slice_type":226,"slice_label":44},"3Column",[152,174,194],{"Title":153,"Description":158,"Image":162,"Label":44,"UrlText":156,"Url":169,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":172,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[154],{"type":155,"text":156,"spans":157},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[159],{"type":64,"text":160,"spans":161,"direction":67},"With an Evri ParcelShop, you’re able to send, collect and return all in one place. We have many ParcelShops located across Cardiff, and many are open longer more flexible hours. So you can drop off or collect your parcels when it’s convenient for you. ",[],{"dimensions":163,"alt":164,"copyright":44,"url":165,"id":166,"edit":167},{"width":52,"height":53},"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":57,"y":168,"zoom":58,"background":59},8,{"link_type":79,"key":170,"url":171},"5dead08a-0fdc-4459-bbe2-a2b6837ffd39","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":173},"Any",{"Title":175,"Description":179,"Image":183,"Label":44,"UrlText":177,"Url":190,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":193,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[176],{"type":155,"text":177,"spans":178},"Lockers",[],[180],{"type":64,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":67},"As well as ParcelShops located around Cardiff, we have many secure Evri Lockers where you can drop off or collect parcels.  ",[],{"dimensions":184,"alt":185,"copyright":44,"url":186,"id":187,"edit":188},{"width":52,"height":53},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":57,"y":189,"zoom":58,"background":59},17,{"link_type":79,"key":191,"url":192},"e2f3e31e-9efb-46fd-bf61-fea77b6ba658","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":173},{"Title":195,"Description":199,"Image":203,"Label":44,"UrlText":197,"Url":210,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":213,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[196],{"type":155,"text":197,"spans":198},"Courier collection",[],[200],{"type":64,"text":201,"spans":202,"direction":67},"Don’t worry if you can’t get out to drop off your parcel, our Evri couriers in Cardiff come straight to your front door or office to collect your parcel. You’ll get a 1 hour collection time so you know when to expect your courier.  ",[],{"dimensions":204,"alt":205,"copyright":44,"url":206,"id":207,"edit":208},{"width":52,"height":53},"An older woman hands a parcel to a courier for collection. The courier is taking a photo.","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10245.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=68%2C0%2C7675%2C5104&w=1000&h=665","Z6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH",{"x":209,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},68,{"link_type":79,"key":211,"url":212},"ca5b59bb-37de-4a15-b573-6a963b4a2373","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":173},{"SectionTitle":215,"SectionDescription":220,"theme":224},[216],{"type":217,"text":218,"spans":219,"direction":67},"heading2","How to send a parcel in Cardiff",[],[221],{"type":64,"text":222,"spans":223,"direction":67},"We want sending parcels to be as easy as possible, which is why we offer 3 simple and quick options to get your parcel on its way.  ",[],"neutral","article_link_module$bed260e1-ff3e-4d98-aae4-b4369a059dae","article_link_module",{"variation":228,"version":25,"items":229,"primary":291,"id":293,"slice_type":148,"slice_label":44},"listComponent",[230,243,255,267,279],{"title":231,"content":232,"icon":236},"Parcel cover",[233],{"type":64,"text":234,"spans":235,"direction":67},"Every parcel includes up to £20 free parcel cover.  You can increase the value up to £999 and choose to add a digital signature for extra peace of mind. Excludes Postable parcels.",[],{"dimensions":237,"alt":239,"copyright":44,"url":240,"id":241,"edit":242},{"width":238,"height":238},40,"Icon of a parcel","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8321288c-05db-46b8-9767-db5da18fbfae_parcel1.svg","Yh96FhIAAC4A-Zr2",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":244,"content":245,"icon":249},"Parcel tracking and notifications",[246],{"type":64,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":67},"Throughout your delivery, you can check on the stages of your parcel with end-to-end tracking for both you and your recipient. You’ll also receive a 1 hour delivery window at no extra cost.  ",[],{"dimensions":250,"alt":251,"copyright":44,"url":252,"id":253,"edit":254},{"width":238,"height":238},"Money icon","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":256,"content":257,"icon":261},"Flexible printing options",[258],{"type":64,"text":259,"spans":260,"direction":67},"Choose to either print your postage labels at home or in-store for FREE using our Print in Store devices. ",[],{"dimensions":262,"alt":263,"copyright":44,"url":264,"id":265,"edit":266},{"width":238,"height":238},"Printer icon","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":268,"content":269,"icon":273},"Easy to use tools",[270],{"type":64,"text":271,"spans":272,"direction":67},"Easily book more than one delivery at once using our Bulk Send and Quick Send tools.  ",[],{"dimensions":274,"alt":275,"copyright":44,"url":276,"id":277,"edit":278},{"width":238,"height":238},"Phone icon","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":280,"content":281,"icon":285},"Photo confirmation of delivery",[282],{"type":64,"text":283,"spans":284,"direction":67},"When we deliver your parcel, we will take a photo as proof so your recipient knows where to find it. ",[],{"dimensions":286,"alt":287,"copyright":44,"url":288,"id":289,"edit":290},{"width":238,"height":238},"Success icon","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"theme":145,"title":292,"description":44},"Why choose Evri in Cardiff?","list_block$214cb5e7-f6a9-4679-b42a-f2810e1163e8",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":295,"primary":296,"id":308,"slice_type":309,"slice_label":44},[],{"title":297,"bodyText":298,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":38,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":44,"buttonLink":302,"image":303},"Are you VAT registered?",[299],{"type":64,"text":300,"spans":301,"direction":67},"Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],{"link_type":173},{"dimensions":304,"alt":44,"copyright":44,"url":305,"id":306,"edit":307},{"width":52,"height":122},"courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&w=1000&h=667","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":126,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},"feature_banner$67d0120f-ab67-47f3-b6fb-da1dd733d41f","feature_banner",{"variation":311,"version":25,"items":312,"primary":314,"id":321,"slice_type":92,"slice_label":44},"cardNoImageWithCta",[313],{},{"CardAvatar":60,"CardTitle":315,"CardText":316,"ButtonText":44,"ButtonUrl":320,"IsEco":20},"Clear time frames",[317],{"type":64,"text":318,"spans":319,"direction":67},"Whether you use our couriers in Cardiff or another location in the UK, we’ll make sure you receive a 1-hour delivery window on the day of collecting and delivery of your parcels. With your 1-hour window, you’ll know exactly when we will be arriving with your parcel. If you or your recipient aren’t available to receive your package, you can easily divert to a chosen neighbour, safe place or one of our ParcelShop or Locker locations, ready to collect at a more convenient time. ",[],{"link_type":173},"card$ca6e06c8-c1db-45dc-82e3-41f975715d06",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":323,"primary":324,"id":333,"slice_type":334,"slice_label":44},[],{"heading":325,"description":326,"image":327},"We're trusted by our customers & retailers","We provide delivery services for most of the UK's top retail brands including Next, ASOS, boohoo, Missguided, PrettyLittleThing, John Lewis, Debenhams, eBay and Amazon.",{"dimensions":328,"alt":329,"copyright":44,"url":330,"id":331,"edit":332},{"width":52,"height":53},"View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house.","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh",{"x":57,"y":168,"zoom":58,"background":59},"trust_pilot$faf93803-3964-4ed7-9cd1-b492566f695c","trust_pilot",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":336,"primary":337,"id":355,"slice_type":92,"slice_label":44},[],{"CardImage":338,"CardAvatar":60,"CardTitle":346,"CardText":347,"ButtonText":351,"ButtonUrl":352,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":339,"alt":342,"copyright":44,"url":343,"id":344,"edit":345},{"width":340,"height":341},5000,3335,"courier opening door of white van and placing cardboard box inside","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Faamh01xvIZEnjXoy_courier%2Btaking%2Bbox%2Bout%2Bof%2Bvan.jpg?auto=format,compress","aamh01xvIZEnjXoy",{"x":57,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},"Looking for work in Cardiff? Become a self-employed Evri courier",[348],{"type":64,"text":349,"spans":350,"direction":67},"Become a self-employed courier in Cardiff and discover the perfect work-life balance. Whether you’re looking for something similar to full-time work or something more flexible, you can deliver parcels how it suits you. ",[],"Find out more",{"link_type":79,"key":353,"url":354},"e61b9397-5060-4ffb-836f-3d196a28db2e","courier-service-cardiff.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fbe-a-courier","card$a8e683c8-5119-429e-9848-282fbafa74df",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":357,"primary":370,"id":372,"slice_type":373,"slice_label":44},[358,364],{"questionTitle":359,"questionBody":360},"Can a courier collect my parcel from home?",[361],{"type":64,"text":362,"spans":363,"direction":67},"Yes, Evri couriers in Cardiff can collect parcels directly from your home or office. You’ll also receive a 1-hour collection window.  ",[],{"questionTitle":365,"questionBody":366},"Do parcels come with cover?",[367],{"type":64,"text":368,"spans":369,"direction":67},"Every parcel includes £20 free parcel cover, with the option to increase coverage up to £999. Excludes postable parcels.  ",[],{"title":371},"Courier services in Cardiff FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$9e07fab5